  "design_risks": [
    "Pending runtime: the 4.3s timed teaching budget uses the prototype observed Walk150 trigger-to-bank 3.367s (estimated 0.933s margin), not only 440cm/150. Re-measure in this saved map.",
    "Pending runtime: combination timed landing x depends on Walk/Run bounce entry. Measure actual countdown trigger x, trigger-to-safe-bank time, and late landings; 4.3s is a candidate budget.",
    "Combination front bank top180; pad top72; target top360. Prior normal-jump foot peak about323 and bounce foot peak about436 suggest 37cm normal-jump exclusion and 76cm bounce clearance, but capsule/step/flight timing can invalidate either estimate.",
    "The existing first bounce teaching is deliberately preserved; Run300 may bypass it with an ordinary jump because that landing is only60cm higher. Do not claim mandatory bounce teaching from first-segment route PASS.",
    "Switch+hazard is a shuttle crossing followed by a warned landing-bank hazard, not a switch-controlled hazard. Validate that both mechanics form a readable shared segment and cannot be skipped accidentally.",
    "All three checkpoints precede the single required pickup. Death resets pickup and mechanisms; test every checkpoint through reacquisition to goal, including timed reset and both-side shuttle recall. No fallback to spawn is accepted.",
    "No static collision exists under the timed gaps or bounce pad. A miss must naturally reach KillZ=-1000 and respawn on the corresponding static bank; check dynamic-platform recovery never traps the capsule.",
    "Final top360 is likely a one-way height change; the required pickup stays after the final checkpoint so return travel is not required. Confirm goal lock, death reset, R reset and pickup overlap.",
    "World camera adaptation sees terrain tag NaiwaP1GeneratedV1 on new static banks; bounce apex/target, countdown and both switch sides still require visible-window framing.",
    "Build success only means saved-and-reloaded actor semantics. New full route, every-checkpoint death retry, Walk/Run real keyboard, visual and recoverable evidence remain pending; old L_NaiwaP1_Full PASS is not applicable."
  ]
